<title>USA: Thomas &amp; Betts sees '97 double-digit growth.</title>
<headline>Thomas &amp; Betts sees '97 double-digit growth.</headline>
<dateline>MEMPHIS, Tenn. 1997-04-22</dateline>
<text>
<p>Thomas &amp; Betts Corp said Tuesday it expects double-digit earnings growth to continue throughout 1997.</p>
<p>Thomas &amp; Betts reported first-quarter net income of $0.55 per share, up 13 percent from $0.49 fa year earlier.</p>
<p>The company said the assimilation of its Augat acquisition is proceeding well and will help it deliver another year of double-digit earnings growth.</p>
<p>Thomas &amp; Betts makes connectors and components for the electrical and electronics markets.</p>
</text>
